&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;(注) １　金額は販売価格によっております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;ｂ．受注状況&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;当社は見込み生産をおこなっているため、該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;ｃ．販売実績&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度における販売実績をセグメントごとに示すと、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0.1pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:467.3pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:234pt;min-width:234pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:148.5pt;min-width:148.5pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:84.8pt;min-width:84.8pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:32pt;min-height:32pt;"&gt;
